{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N014","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 014 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"你有没有注意到，那些高转化的链接，往往前台显示一个高高在上的原价，然后再标出一个“优惠价格”——这种心理锚定机制，会大大提升买家的购买意愿。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N016","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 016 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"但问题是，很多卖家设置了划线价，却用不了几天就掉了，前台什么也不显示了。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N017","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 017 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"那划线价到底怎么设置？怎么才能长期维持？还有哪些办法可以快速搞定高额度划线价？","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
