{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N019","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 019 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"划线价本质上是一个“心理对比锚点”。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N020","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 020 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"举个例子：同样是$29.99的产品，如果前台没有对比价，那买家就会认为这就是合理售价。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N022","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 022 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"但如果你前台显示“原价$49.99，现价$29.99”，即使你还是卖$29.99，买家也更容易产生“我捡到了便宜”的心理，促使下单。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
{"record_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68-DOCX-N023","source_id":"SRC-f564d5134e68","source_location":"DOCX body node 023 (paragraph)","content_type":"paragraph","content":"所以，划线价的本质，是制造折扣冲动。","source_sha256":"b3628e229d3fd1cb2f3244117de4e134cc0e6c4fc26f7b48d9631de536911dd1","reviewed_at":"2026-08-18"}
